	(text "BLOQUE 20 - BUCK 5 V NO AISLADO (opcion B)\nFuente: TI LMR38010 SNVSC73B (sept. 2023), tablas 8-1 y 9-1, seccion 9.2.\n\n  U201  LMR38010SQDDARQ1 (80 V, 1 A, PFM + spread spectrum, AEC-Q100), HSOIC-8 PowerPAD (DDA0008B).\n        PROTO: LMR38010SDDAR (LCSC C5219310, equivalente comercial; campo MPN_PROTO).\n        Pines: 1 GND | 2 EN -> +VPROT | 3 VIN -> +VPROT | 4 RT/SYNC -> BUCK_RT | 5 FB -> BUCK_FB | 6 PG (sin uso)\n               7 BOOT -> BUCK_BOOT | 8 SW -> BUCK_SW | EP -> GND_VEH\n        Huella: Package_SO:SOIC-8-1EP_3.9x4.9mm_P1.27mm_EP2.95x4.9mm_Mask2.71x3.4mm_ThermalVias (6 vias de 0.2 mm en el EP).\n\n  +VPROT (6.5-38.4 V, recortado por el LM74930) -> 5.02 V / 1 A a 400 kHz.  L201 33 uH, C_OUT 3 x 22 uF, C_IN 4.7 uF + 100 nF.\n  Carga en +5V_VEH: TPS62A02 (ESP32-S3, picos de TX ~0.4 A a 5 V), ADM3055E (180-260 mA), LP5907, buffers de DO: ~0.7 A pico.\n  Pin a pin con el LMR38020 (2 A) si hiciera falta margen.\nLayout: lazo VIN-C201/C202-GND minimo; EP con vias a GND_VEH; divisor de FB pegado al pin 5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4a285891-9055-40e8-8e4a-f074c9537a5d")
	)
